Successfully create PG ring pattern core_ring_pattern.
set_pg_strategy core_ring_strategy \
    -core \
    -pattern {{name: core_ring_pattern} \
              {nets: {VDD VSS}} \
              {offset: {1.0 1.0}}}
Successfully set PG strategy core_ring_strategy.
