# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. STANDARD-CELL POWER RAILS
#
# M1 is horizontal.
# If rail width is omitted ICC2 uses the standard-cell PG
# pin dimensions, avoiding an arbitrary M1 width assumption.
# ------------------------------------------------------------
